{"title":"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The fraction <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/d/13d1871697d299a5bcdc57323c14a70305d63147.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a^2+b^2-c^2+2ab}{a^2+c^2-b^2+2ac}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"143\" height=\"40\" /> is (with suitable restrictions of the values of a, b, and c):\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/e/7ce7284cfec356ebd612d2e01eef0cca94005f02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) irreducible}\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"106\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/3/0834b800e93efd13a97cd416dc49a514336b4a4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(B) reducible to negative 1}\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"194\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/f/0af487090b422a6617aede4c777f65f455c1c502.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(C) reducible to a polynomial of three terms}\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"323\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/b/fbb03eb16c958a7adc77cf3021003cddd43a42a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(D) reducible to} \\frac{a-b+c}{a+b-c}\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"189\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/7/067652459b28a2b31de9befe96c4533c73d26462.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(E) reducible to} \\frac{a+b-c}{a-b+c}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"187\" height=\"39\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Use the commutative property to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/d/a0d12f66df908afa863c4390bc0f0aa472e85c08.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{a^2+2ab+b^2-c^2}{a^2+2ac+c^2-b^2}\\]\" width=\"141\" height=\"41\" />\nFactor perfect square trinomials to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/f/5bf5177bbad0e1e66d007c9cd420af612a9ae8ab.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{(a+b)^2-c^2}{(a+c)^2-b^2}\\]\" width=\"99\" height=\"43\" />\nFactor difference of squares to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/f/61f173cc199d663262416d2cf327a8c9b01d77a6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{(a+b+c)(a+b-c)}{(a+b+c)(a-b+c)}\\]\" width=\"168\" height=\"43\" />\nCancel out like terms (with suitable restrictions of a, b, c) to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/4/b2447cde2342e33d8618c330db9d24f78c68b50b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{a+b-c}{a-b+c}\\]\" width=\"70\" height=\"39\" />\nThe answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/f/6bfc0829f3f29bbf35d0a861644e00cfef0f50ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"39\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:c